# Optional: enable the WalletConnect option in the connect modal.
# MetaMask / injected wallets work WITHOUT this. Get a free id at
# https://cloud.walletconnect.com and uncomment:
# VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id_here

# Optional: Ethereum mainnet RPC endpoint used by useV1VaultBalance.js to read
# the legacy USGold V1 "old vault" wallet balance for the Vault custody
# report. Defaults to a public endpoint (https://eth.llamarpc.com). If that
# gets rate-limited or blocked from your deployment, set your own
# (Alchemy/Infura/QuickNode etc):
# VITE_ETHEREUM_RPC_URL=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/your_key_here
